                <pb facs="0467" n="459" sameAs="frus:frus1941v03/pg459"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">391.1115/12: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-09-09T08:00:00+03:25">September 9, 1941—8
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received September 10—9:35 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>142. Although communications have still not been reestablished throughout the
                    country I have had indirect word from all places where we have citizens and
                    believe it safe now to state that all Americans in Iran are safe.</p>
                <p>Please inform Presbyterian Mission Board.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
